#
# Cross-platform interrupt/exception vector table. On x86-64 this is the IDT
# loaded via lidt. On AArch64 this maps to the exception vector table loaded
# via VBAR_EL1. Data structures are architecture-neutral; only the load
# instruction uses arch-block asm.
